From afe1a7ebe60b560ae6457b161f39c5883906ca9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yohan <you@example.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 18:48:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Batch 5C: recommended investigator actions

- GET /api/v1/emails/:emailId now attaches advisory 'recommendations'
  (action, priority, reason, supportingEvidence), derived from stored
  risk/domain/infrastructure results plus a Batch 5B correlation check
- recommendations.ts: never executes actions; never relies solely on the
  LLM assessment; never fabricates evidence; missing-evidence case takes
  priority and short-circuits other recommendations
- new types: RecommendedActionType, RecommendationPriority, Recommendation
- 17 new tests (recommendations.test.ts, emails-recommendations.test.ts),
  211/211 passing
- npm run build clean
